flowchart LR
  subgraph Create[Creation and collection]
    POS[POS signup / cashier]
    WEB[SavannaShop checkout]
    LOY[Loyalty app registration]
    MM[Mobile-money linkage]
  end
  POS --> V[Channel validation and notice]
  WEB --> V
  LOY --> V
  MM --> V
  V -->|online| SRC[Local source database]
  V -->|offline| Q[Signed local queue with event ID]
  Q -->|reconnect, idempotent replay| SRC
  SRC --> HUB[Integration hub and source crosswalk]
  HUB --> REVIEW[Customer steward match review]
  REVIEW --> GOLD[Golden ID plus provenance]
  GOLD --> USE[Purpose-limited CRM / loyalty / analytics]
  USE --> SHARE[Approved processor or partner share]
  USE --> ARCH[Restricted archive per approved schedule]
  SHARE --> LOG[Access and transfer log]
  ARCH --> DEL[Verified deletion / legal hold]
  DEL --> EVID[Deletion receipt and audit record]
  V -. failure: invalid or duplicate signup .-> EX[Exception queue and store steward]
  HUB -. failure: false merge .-> UNMERGE[Reversible link / rights review]
  SHARE -. failure: uncontrolled export .-> INCIDENT[Incident response]
  classDef failure fill:#fff1f0,stroke:#bd2c00,color:#111
  class EX,UNMERGE,INCIDENT failure
